<title>USA: TENNIS-LEADING 1997 MONEY WINNERS ON WTA TOUR.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEADING 1997 MONEY WINNERS ON WTA TOUR.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Florida 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
